### Login Supervisor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "supervisor@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get Supervisor Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/supervisor/profile

### Update Supervisor Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/supervisor/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Ahmed Bello",
  "department": "Software Engineering"
}

### Get My Supervisions
GET http://localhost:5000/api/supervisor/supervisions

### Get Supervision by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/supervisor/supervisions/01ad2658-0729-46a6-b1ec-f0d74c2d93a5

### Update Supervision Notes
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/supervisor/supervisions/01ad2658-0729-46a6-b1ec-f0d74c2d93a5/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Student is performing well. Regular progress meetings are ongoing."
}